### ===============================
### 6. 관리자 (AdminController)
### ===============================

### 6-1. 회원 목록 조회 (전체)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/users?page=0&size=20
X-User-Id: 1

### 6-2. 회원 목록 조회 (이메일 검색)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/users?email=test&page=0&size=20
X-User-Id: 1

### 6-3. 회원 목록 조회 (상태 필터)
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/users?status=ACTIVE&page=0&size=20
X-User-Id: 1

### 6-4. 회원 상세 조회
GET http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/users/1
X-User-Id: 1

### 6-5. 회원 상태 변경 (정지)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/users/1/status
X-User-Id: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "BLOCK"
}

### 6-6. 회원 상태 변경 (활성화로 복구)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/users/1/status
X-User-Id: 1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": "ACTIVE"
}

### 6-7. 회원 권한 변경 (ADMIN 부여)
PUT http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/users/1/roles
X-User-Id: 2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "ADMIN"
}

### 안됨
### 6-8. 회원 삭제
DELETE http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/users/1
X-User-Id: 1

### 6-9. 강제 로그아웃
POST http://localhost:8080/api/v1/admin/users/1/force-logout
X-User-Id: 1